	text: [
		"Make sure your rocket contains the following parts:",
		"- Rocket engine(s)",
		"- Fuel tank(s)",
		"- Seat(s)",
		"- Guidance Computer",
		"",
		"Additionally you can add inventory blocks such as chests. Mind you, these contribute heavily to the weight of the rocket and thus require more fuel and thrust from the engines.",
