		"Place this block neighboring the launch pad border but one block higher than the launch pad blocks for it to function",
		"",
		"If you scan your rocket make sure your amount of thrust is higher than the weight of the rocket. The acceleration should also be higher than 0 m/s^2.",
		"Lastly check that your fuel usage is in the green. ",
		"",
		"Once you click build the rocket will transform in an entity. You can jump onto your rocket by right clicking it.",
		"To interact with the rocket shift right-click the rocket. This allows you to interact with all the inventories on the rocket."
